{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06584","headline":"安宜园林献高使君 · 储光羲","name":"安宜园林献高使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直道已三出，幸从江上回。\n新居茅茨逈，起见秋云开。\n十里次舟楫，二桥交往来。\n楚言满邻里，鴈呌喧池台。\n鱼鳖乐仁政，浮沈亦至哉。\n小山宜大隐，要自望蓬莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}